WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.053
Today we will reuse materials while arranging an image. Our work connects with

00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:06.920
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:11.346
Sort clean paper by colour and select pieces for your picture.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.081
Arrange pieces on cardboard before applying glue. Record why your chosen technique

00:00:17.081 --> 00:00:18.301
suits the message.

00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:21.783
Stick the pieces down and explain the main image.
